HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0200.fits, spectra0201.fits,          HISTORY spectra0202.fits, spectra0203.fits, spectra0204.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0205.fits, spectra0206.fits, spectra0207.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0218.fits, spectra0219.fits, spectra0220.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0221.fits, spectra0222.fits, spectra0223.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0224.fits, spectra0225.fits, spectra0226.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0227.fits, spectra0228.fits, spectra0229.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0230.fits, spectra0231.fits, spectra0232.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0233.fits were combined using a robust weighted mean             HISTORY with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The             HISTORY scale factors were determined using order 1 and are:                    HISTORY 5.263353596091922, 2.533598259359449, 1.2962124065442946,               HISTORY 0.9796130803669786, 1.100703642784805, 0.772807228486373,               HISTORY 0.8184478711719467, 1.0791097070669409, 1.1875450752936,                HISTORY 1.0212535066990065, 0.8420043952148959, 0.6608568665562438,             HISTORY 0.5993041779554377, 0.499346666069718, 0.5873661557315241,              HISTORY 0.5452074682042639, 0.5628143478166859, 0.5869917089327986,             HISTORY 0.6959630364487964, 1.1822452610129757, 1.940723994416762,              HISTORY 4.913673753475058, 4.287684835072836, 2.1370215836118023.               END                                                                             